  "properties": {
    "title": "ImageN for GeoSpatial",
    "description": "Introducing ImageN as amazing raster image procession engine for the Java GeoSpatial Community.\n\nImageN is an raster image processing engine taking shape at the Eclipse Foundation. Combining a code donation of the Java Advanced Imaging framework with the years of performance enhancements and geospatial features provided by the JAI-Ext and JAITools projects.\r\n\r\nI am so excited to share this one, I have been planning it literally for over a decade - and it is here! Attend this  talk and buy me a beer!",
